{
  "id": "poem-f9338cf60f07ed5c9e1f5b11",
  "title": "有狐",
  "author": "佚名",
  "dynasty": "先秦",
  "verses": [
    "有狐绥绥，在彼淇梁。心之忧矣，之子无裳。",
    "有狐绥绥，在彼淇厉。心之忧矣，之子无带。",
    "有狐绥绥，在彼淇侧。心之忧矣，之子无服。"
  ],
  "enabled": true,
  "collection": "诗经",
  "tags": [],
  "source": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee/诗经/shijing.json#record-62"
